IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. REDEFEX.
AUTHOR. JU

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-DOB PIC X(8).
01 WS-DOB-DETAILS REDEFINES WS-DOB.
   05 WS-DAY   PIC X(2).
   05 WS-MONTH PIC X(2).
   05 WS-YEAR  PIC X(4).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE "15082001" TO WS-DOB.
    DISPLAY "FULL DATE: " WS-DOB.
    DISPLAY "DAY: " WS-DAY.
    DISPLAY "MONTH: " WS-MONTH.
    DISPLAY "YEAR: " WS-YEAR.

    STOP RUN.
